# Artist's Talent, level 1: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card." With the
# Class on the battlefield, Bot1 casts an Ornithopter (a creature spell): nothing triggers and Bot1 is asked nothing (the
# refusal beside the positive control). It then casts Lightning Bolt (noncreature): Bot1 discards the Island and draws the
# Plains on top of its library, so its hand is the Plains alone, and Bot2 takes 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Artist's Talent
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

