Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artist's Talent.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Island)

